diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:5:13: List[String] has no method `size`
  print(names.size())
              ^^^^
Emerald calls this `count`. It is a property, so write `.count` without parentheses.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:6:13: List[String] has no property `isEmpty`
  print(names.isEmpty)
              ^^^^^^^
Emerald calls this `empty?`. It is a method, so write `.empty?()` with parentheses.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:7:12: Dict[String, Int] has no method `containsKey`
  print(ages.containsKey("Ava"))
             ^^^^^^^^^^^
Emerald calls this `contains_key?`.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:8:12: String has no method `toUpperCase`
