             ^^^^^^^^^^^
Emerald calls this `upper`.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:9:12: String has no method `join`
  print(", ".join(names))
             ^^^^
`join` belongs to the list, not the separator: write `words.join(", ")`, with the separator as the argument.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:10:18: String has no method `format`
  print("Hello {}".format(word))
                   ^^^^^^
A String has no `format`. Put values in the text with interpolation, as in `"Hello #{name}"`.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:11:12: String has no method `charAt`
  print(word.charAt(0))
             ^^^^^^
A String is indexed with brackets: `word[0]` is its first character.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:12:12: String has no method `pad_left`
  print(word.pad_left(8))
             ^^^^^^^^
Emerald calls this `pad_start`.
diagnostics/familiar-member-names.em:13:12: Set[Int] has no method `intersect`
